			description: [
		"The amount of steam produced by the hot sodium-potassium alloy far exceeds that of a super-dimensional boiler."
		""
		"Supercritical sodium-potassium alloy can also be used to obtain supercritical steam, which can be used to generate electricity for supercritical steam turbines."
		""
		"In addition to the thermal sodium-potassium alloy formula, the heat exchanger is not affected by the configurable maintenance compartment."
		""
		"Hot sodium-potassium alloys come from low-temperature (≤825K) fission reactors, and supercritical sodium-potassium alloys come from high-temperature (>825K) fission reactors."
