			description: [
		"&6&l» Enhanced version special for IV large machines"
		""
		"&6&l» Core Features"
		"&f- With the extremely noble &bcross-recipe type parallelism &f, one machine can handle all supported recipe types simultaneously."
		"&f- has the noble &bcross-recipe thread &f, the number of threads increases according to the voltage, up to &e17 &f."
		"&f- Because of the parallelism across recipe types, each machine only needs to produce &eand one &fto meet the needs."
		""
		"&4&l» Important restrictions"
		"&c- Machine cross-recipe type parallelization mandatory requires super sample assembly"
		"&c- If you need passive output, please install the normal input and output warehouse and it will automatically switch to normal mode."
		"&c- If you add additional AE attachments, resulting in the written template without a recipe type, the machine will refuse to display the template."
		"&c- If you put a template in recipe mode that is not supported by the current machine into the machine, the machine will refuse to display the template."
	]
