		{
			dependencies: ["27BA6EBA81622516"]
			description: [
		"To put it simply, it is to let the machine take items directly from the ME network and use them."
		""
		"Use &dflash memory &rto save the warehouse configuration by left-clicking and right-clicking to apply the configuration."
		""
		"&6automatic pull mode &rcan be turned on to automatically pull inventory items/fluids in the network (&btag bus can set pull sorting mode &r)"
		""
		"Use the &dwire cutter &rto right-click the ME warehouse to switch the ME warehouse between networking from the front and networking from any side."
		""
		"&6pull interval &rcan be adjusted in the lower left corner of the warehouse gui. The default display is 0tick, which means the pull interval is not changed. &bis at least 1tick &r(affects the speed of pulling from the ME network)"
		""
		"The &dextreme pull mode &rcan be turned on in the gtlcore configuration file, so that the &6ME inventory input assembly &rpull will no longer have a delay (affects parallel computing), but it may have a certain impact on TPS"
		""
		"The tag inventory bus/bin is used in the same way as the tag storage bus"
		""
		"注意：1.由于在进入存档时AE需要重新组网，库存仓室会在一段很短的时间内断网进而导致无法使机器获得输入"
		""
		"2. Multiple inventory input bins/buses in the same multi-block structure cannot be marked with the same content."
	]
